f7c559d0-4771-4683-8348-5fe1784f60e9	sublime	published	Sublime	Design and Tech	Sublime	https://pub-92e6c519d94e4cfaa06f90db8f64c6a9.r2.dev/uploads/blog/1784977780989-f27bff8a6a22.png	Redesigned Sublime House of Tea’s digital presence with immersive UX, refined UI, and creative direction reflecting the elegance and ritual of modern tea culture.	Sublime	Your Journey Into the World of Premium Tea	Design and Tech	[{"link": "", "label": "Website"}, {"link": "", "label": "DEVELOPMENT"}]	/uploads/blog/1784204196358-afd5575fc4b8.png	\N	Redesigned Sublime House of Tea’s digital presence with immersive UX, refined UI, and creative direction reflecting modern tea culture’s elegance and ritual.	[{"name": [{"name": "Siddharth Bajpai"}], "designation": "Head of Design"}, {"name": [{"name": "Pratibha Mishra"}], "designation": "Account Manager"}, {"name": [{"name": "Keshav Yadav"}], "designation": "Tech Lead"}, {"name": [{"name": "Shivam Tiwari"}], "designation": "UX Lead"}, {"name": [{"name": "Toral Mistry"}], "designation": "UI Lead"}, {"name": [{"name": "Shivam Tiwari"}], "designation": "UX Designer"}, {"name": [{"name": "Ashwin Pradeep"}], "designation": "UI Designer"}, {"name": [{"name": "Ajay Jangam"}], "designation": "Web Developer"}]	[{"title": "The Problem Statement", "ImageAlt": "Sublime House of Tea old website shown on a MacBook mockup", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784204213999-d3002835947e.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "The previous website struggled to fully communicate the premium nature and storytelling behind the brand while also facing usability and performance challenges. Navigation lacked clarity, product discovery felt fragmented, and the overall experience did not create the immersive journey expected from a modern specialty tea brand. From a technical perspective, the website faced performance bottlenecks, inconsistent user flows, and limitations in responsiveness across devices. These issues impacted page load efficiency, content accessibility, and overall engagement, creating friction throughout the customer journey."}]}, {"title": "Our Strategy", "ImageAlt": "Sublime strategy — responsive desktop, tablet and mobile device mockups", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784204231805-e90b3eb13732.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "Our strategy focused on creating a slower, more intentional browsing experience inspired by the calm and sensory nature of tea rituals. We simplified the user journey, refined the content hierarchy, and introduced a more immersive visual storytelling approach across the platform."}, {"description": "The design system was built around earthy aesthetics, elegant typography, clean layouts, and product focused interactions that help users explore the brand in a more engaging and memorable way."}]}, {"title": "Optimized for Every Screen", "ImageAlt": "Sublime responsive layouts across desktop, tablet and mobile", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784204242114-01e967127db1.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "The experience was designed with a responsive and mobile first approach to ensure smooth navigation and consistency across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. Every layout, interaction, and content structure was optimized to maintain clarity, elegance, and usability while delivering a seamless browsing experience across all screen sizes."}]}, {"title": "Technology Used", "ImageAlt": "Technology stack logos — Figma, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, jQuery", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784204255530-160c2db929bf.png"}, {"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784204258170-a621b36e1a95.png"}], "layout": "half"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "We used Figma to craft a visually refined and user focused interface, ensuring a seamless balance between storytelling, usability, and modern aesthetics. HTML and CSS were used to build a clean and structured frontend, while JavaScript and jQuery helped create interactive and engaging user experiences across the platform. Together, these technologies enabled us to deliver a responsive, smooth, and visually immersive digital experience aligned with the brand’s premium identity."}]}, {"title": "Our Solution", "ImageAlt": "Sublime solution — rebuilt platform mockups", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784204277385-2155084c4a3f.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "We rebuilt the digital experience from the ground up, combining thoughtful UX strategy with a scalable technical foundation. The platform was redesigned to improve content discoverability, simplify navigation, and create a more immersive product exploration journey that reflects the sophistication of the brand"}, {"description": "On the technical side, the website was optimized for performance, responsiveness, and long term scalability. From streamlined page structures and improved loading efficiency to mobile first interactions and seamless browsing experiences, every element was crafted to deliver a faster, smoother, and more engaging user journey."}]}]	Conclusion	[{"image": "", "content": "The Sublime House of Tea website transformation successfully bridged the gap between brand storytelling, user experience, and technical performance. By combining refined design systems with a modern web architecture, the platform now delivers a premium digital experience that feels elegant, intuitive, and effortless to navigate. The result is a future ready platform that not only showcases the brand more effectively but also creates stronger user engagement through improved performance, seamless functionality, and immersive storytelling."}]	2026-07-16 12:18:00.524+00	2026-07-16 11:25:07.81745+00	2026-07-25 11:36:03.941217+00	\N	\N	\N	https://pub-92e6c519d94e4cfaa06f90db8f64c6a9.r2.dev/uploads/blog/1784979361545-a8d01623728e.png
f0bdc438-9db6-43a7-af8d-4dfa1e8a9e6b	page-industries	published	Page Industries	FMCG & Consumer Goods	UI/UX	https://pub-92e6c519d94e4cfaa06f90db8f64c6a9.r2.dev/uploads/blog/1784979289062-1c3585800ead.png	Redesigned Page Industries' corporate website into a premium, structured digital identity reflecting their scale, leadership, and global ambition.	Page Industries	Elevating Page Industries' Digital Identity	UI/UX Design	[{"link": "", "label": "Corporate Website Redesign"}]	/uploads/blog/1784267712350-d82c412dd683.png	/uploads/blog/1784268084143-ffa895245bf0.png	We reshaped Page Industries' digital presence to reflect the scale, values, leadership, and global ambition of a modern corporate brand.	[{"name": [{"name": "Siddharth Bajpai"}], "designation": "Head of Design"}, {"name": [{"name": "Vaishnavi Isal"}], "designation": "Account Manager"}, {"name": [{"name": "Saakshi Kumber"}], "designation": "UX Designer"}, {"name": [{"name": "Ashwin Pradeep"}], "designation": "UI Designer"}, {"name": [{"name": "Darshak Jadhav"}], "designation": "UI Designer"}, {"name": [{"name": "Pranay Sawant"}], "designation": "UI Designer"}]	[{"title": "The Problem Statement", "ImageAlt": "Old vs New Page Industries corporate website screenshots", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784268094610-cb7e91535753.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784267794630-f6ec11a72853.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "Page Industries' old website did not reflect the stature of the company. It felt basic, scattered, and difficult to navigate. Important information was missing, pages lacked depth, and the experience failed to show how big, trusted, and established the brand truly is. The need was clear, create a website that feels premium, structured, and worthy of a corporate leader."}]}, {"title": "Our Strategy", "ImageAlt": "Page Industries website wireframes and UI design mockups", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784268100753-e2abad99e1f1.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784267852647-1660b0e89eb3.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "We focused on building a strong corporate identity through design. The goal was to move from a simple, complex site to a refined, premium, functional experience. We reworked the structure, added meaningful pages, and shaped a journey that clearly tells Page's story its values, scale, and vision. Every screen was designed to feel confident, clear, and professional."}]}, {"title": "Information Architecture & Navigation", "ImageAlt": "Page Industries mobile hamburger menu and desktop mega menu navigation", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784268107086-6782cfede9dd.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784267869700-0a2b484bc3d2.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "We simplified how users move through the website. Content was grouped with purpose, pages were restructured, and the flow was designed to feel natural and easy to follow. This helped users quickly understand who Page Industries is and what it stands for without feeling lost or overwhelmed. Multiple navigation tests ensured that even complex corporate information feels simple and approachable."}]}, {"title": "Optimized for Every Screen", "ImageAlt": "Responsive design mockups of the Page Industries website across devices", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784268175792-3639c3b49c5a.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784267952815-43d827e3637a.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "The experience was designed with mobile users in mind from the start. We ran multiple user tests to make sure navigation feels effortless on smaller screens. Content is broken into clean sections, making it easy to scan, read, and explore whether on desktop or mobile. The result is a smooth, consistent experience across all devices."}]}, {"title": "Typography & Visual Expression", "ImageAlt": "Typography (Be Vietnam) and colour palette: #4685d2, #d32f2f, #963F55, #31CDBB, #299DDF", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784268127013-3b63d4d5e3dc.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784267962280-0f7f9b24afc3.png"}, {"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784268130774-2fb13c0b08c5.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784267967665-441c5edbfae0.png"}], "layout": "half"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "The visual style was created to feel premium and modern. Clean typography, balanced spacing, and a refined colour palette give the website a calm, confident tone. Each section has its own identity while staying part of one strong system. This helps the content breathe and keeps the experience clear, elegant, and easy to engage with."}]}, {"title": "Motion & Interaction Design", "ImageAlt": "Motion and interaction design showcase", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784268136850-364389ae6a84.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784268026376-43c16ba8abae.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "Subtle animations bring the website to life. Transitions, hovers, and micro-interactions guide attention and make navigation feel smooth and intuitive. These small details add depth and polish, creating a sense of quality without distracting from the content."}]}, {"title": "Our Solution", "ImageAlt": "Page Industries redesigned website solution showcase", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784268142773-d4240715414c.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784268037913-ce97eb2b8c67.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "We delivered a complete design transformation for Page Industries. From structure to screens, every part of the website was reimagined. New pages, clearer flows, and a unified design system now present Page Industries as a strong corporate brand beyond just its consumer labels. The platform now communicates trust, scale, and ambition with clarity."}]}]	Conclusion	[{"image": "", "content": "The new Page Industries website is not just better looking it tells a stronger story. It reflects a brand that balances legacy with innovation and professionalism with warmth. What was once basic and fragmented is now a premium, confident, and cohesive digital presence worthy of the organisation it represents."}]	2026-07-16 11:26:08.52+00	2026-07-16 11:26:08.934859+00	2026-07-25 11:34:56.357937+00	\N	\N	\N	https://pub-92e6c519d94e4cfaa06f90db8f64c6a9.r2.dev/uploads/blog/1784979291711-de6000fca6cc.png
a101da8a-9380-4113-943d-421c4982d8e2	speedo-india	published	Speedo India	E-commerce	Speedo	https://pub-92e6c519d94e4cfaa06f90db8f64c6a9.r2.dev/uploads/blog/1784979326580-bee54d7816ff.png	Transformed Speedo India's online shopping experience with revamped A+ content, icon-led infographics and a refreshed visual language.	Speedo India	Diving Into Digital Waters: A Seamless Swimwear Shopping Experience	e-commerce website	[]	/uploads/blog/speedo-hero-banner.png	\N	Transformed Speedo India's online shopping experience, revamped their A+ content, introduced icon led infographics that simplified product understanding and enhanced product discovery. Refreshed their iconic visual language that reflects delivering a seamless and engaging e-commerce experience.	[{"name": [{"name": "Siddharth Bajpai"}], "designation": "Head of Design"}, {"name": [{"name": "Toral Mistry"}], "designation": "Project Lead"}, {"name": [{"name": "Praneeth Ravi"}], "designation": "UX Analyst"}, {"name": [{"name": "Pravin Gawali"}], "designation": "Sr. UI Designer"}, {"name": [{"name": "Rickma Mary"}], "designation": "UI Designer"}, {"name": [{"name": "Bharat Dhimmar"}], "designation": "Interaction Designer"}]	[{"title": "Problem Statement", "ImageAlt": "Old Speedo India website screenshots", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784203426008-76d7bcdbe5f5.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "/uploads/blog/1784202395469-311a67c68ab3.png", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "Despite being a globally recognised brand, Speedo India faced hurdles in its digital journey. Users found it hard to navigate the site, resulting in low conversion rates and poor product discoverability."}, {"description": "<p>There was a clear need to:</p><ul class=\\"tight\\" data-tight=\\"true\\"><li><p>Modernise the digital experience</p></li><li><p>Improve swimwear category visibility</p></li><li><p>Enhance the A+ creatives content and infographics</p></li></ul><p></p>"}]}, {"title": "Our Strategy", "ImageAlt": "", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "Revamped User Journey"}, {"description": "We redesigned the user flow to be smooth and immersive, enhancing every step with motion-led visuals and a clean, intuitive interface."}, {"description": "Elevated Product Discovery"}, {"description": "We introduced engaging A+ creatives and interactive infographics that explain fabric types, their benefits, and intended use, helping users choose the right swimwear with confidence."}, {"description": "Enhanced Brand Experience"}, {"description": "Speedo's performance first identity was brought to life through bold visuals and inspiring storytelling, creating a high impact, scroll worthy experience."}]}, {"title": "Competitor Analysis", "ImageAlt": "Competitor positioning quadrant chart (Nike Swim, Arena, Nabaiji, Speedo, Decathlon)", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784203455104-d1224d2362c4.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "/uploads/blog/1784202487168-bbd9f4049b63.png", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "/uploads/blog/1784202546991-df7f69e114d6.png", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "Gain valuable insights into market dynamics and competitor positioning through our comprehensive quadrant analyses. Explore the latest traffic growth trends, brand perception metrics, and cost effectiveness data to inform strategic decision making and stay ahead in the competitive landscape."}]}, {"title": "Implementation: Homepage & Navigation", "ImageAlt": "Homepage, Shop The Look and Mega Menu mockups", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "/uploads/blog/speedo-s4-hamburger.png", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784203483476-12462f627258.png"}], "layout": "full"}, {"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784203497901-2386910c3717.png"}, {"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784203529004-d4ba08f8b092.png"}], "layout": "half"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "/uploads/blog/speedo-s4-pdp.png", "ImageMobile2": "/uploads/blog/speedo-s4-gear.png", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "/uploads/blog/speedo-s4-megamenu.png", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "The homepage features minimalist hero banners with fluid swim-motion graphics that instantly capture Speedo's dynamic brand energy."}, {"description": "Contextual \\"Shop Now\\" CTAs guide users seamlessly into curated categories based on intent."}, {"description": "A sticky navigation bar with a visual mega menu ensures easy access to all products, while the \\"Shop Swim Essentials\\" section (Shop the Look) helps users discover complete gear sets perfectly paired for training, racing, or leisure."}]}, {"title": "A+ Creatives", "ImageAlt": "A+ content creatives showcase (Endurance+, Chlorine resistant, UPF 40+, Splashback, Extended Leg, Inner front lining)", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "/uploads/blog/speedo-s5-overlay.png", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784203545841-1c9a16e6b39e.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "/uploads/blog/speedo-s5-product.png", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "We revamped all A+ content creatives with high impact visuals and clean layouts that clearly highlight the key benefits of each product. From fabric tech to fit guidance, every element was designed to educate and convert at a glance."}]}, {"title": "Infographics", "ImageAlt": "Feature infographics and swimwear category showcase tiles", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "/uploads/blog/speedo-s6-infographic.png", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784203557203-d8d64971c07c.png"}], "layout": "full"}, {"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784203568140-b90215f108e2.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "/uploads/blog/speedo-s6-infographic.png", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "We created informative infographics that break down product materials in a simple, iconized format for quick understanding. Each fabric type is paired with visual cues and purpose driven icons to help users make confident, informed choices."}]}, {"title": "Impact", "ImageAlt": "", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "+30% Higher Engagement via Visual Mega Menu"}, {"description": "The intuitive, icon based mega menu made navigation effortless, helping users explore categories like suits, goggles, and accessories with ease."}, {"description": "+25% Boost in Product Understanding"}, {"description": "Revamped A+ creatives made product features and benefits clearer, leading to more confident purchase decisions."}, {"description": "Enhanced User Experience"}, {"description": "Icon led fabric infographics simplified technical details, making it easier for users to choose the right gear."}]}, {"title": "Design Stack", "ImageAlt": "Design tools showcase (Figma, Adobe Photoshop, Adobe Firefly)", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "/uploads/blog/speedo-s8-firefly.png", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784203588337-b71d2188109b.png"}, {"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784203593735-94835237f28b.png"}], "layout": "half"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "/uploads/blog/speedo-s8-photoshop.png", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "To bring Speedo's refreshed digital experience to life, we used a combination of powerful creative tools,"}, {"description": "Figma for UI/UX design, wireframes, and interactive prototyping,"}, {"description": "Adobe Photoshop for high impact visuals, banners, and A+ creatives"}, {"description": "AI-powered tools for generating product mockups, iconography, and speeding up production and enhancing creative quality across various devices."}, {"description": "These tools enabled a seamless blend of precision design, dynamic content, and efficiency throughout the project."}]}]	Conclusion	[{"image": "", "content": "Our collaboration with Speedo India redefined how users interact with performance swimwear online. By combining strategic UX enhancements, compelling A+ content, and informative visual storytelling, we delivered a seamless, intuitive, and visually engaging platform. The revamped experience not only boosted product discovery and engagement but also reinforced Speedo's position as a trusted, performance first brand in the Indian market. This transformation sets the stage for continued digital growth and deeper customer connection."}]	2026-07-16 10:30:07.582+00	2026-07-16 10:22:31.142924+00	2026-07-25 11:35:36.522264+00	\N	\N	\N	https://pub-92e6c519d94e4cfaa06f90db8f64c6a9.r2.dev/uploads/blog/1784979332524-dbfe4a34f4bd.png
524ab6f1-cc5a-43d6-90e5-80479e52a0cc	tot-learning	published	TOT Learning	Design and Tech	TOT	https://pub-92e6c519d94e4cfaa06f90db8f64c6a9.r2.dev/uploads/blog/1784977802680-883102d5e176.png	Reimagined TOT Learning’s online presence through thoughtful UX, modern UI, and emotionally resonant storytelling to build trust and drive meaningful parent engagement.	TOT	Where Little Minds Begin Big Journeys	Design and Tech	[{"link": "", "label": "Website"}, {"link": "", "label": "Branding"}, {"link": "", "label": "Development"}]	/uploads/blog/1784273513055-4a858d97f7c3.png	/uploads/blog/1784274440663-dd47dde93e23.png	Reimagined TOT Learning’s online presence through thoughtful UX, modern UI, and emotionally resonant storytelling to build trust and drive meaningful parent engagement.	[{"name": [{"name": "Siddharth Bajpai"}], "designation": "Head of Design"}, {"name": [{"name": "Amit Singhania"}], "designation": "Brand Designer"}, {"name": [{"name": "Shivam Tiwari"}], "designation": "UI Designer"}, {"name": [{"name": "Shivam Tiwari"}], "designation": "Web Developer"}, {"name": [{"name": "Chinmay Zope"}], "designation": "Web Developer"}]	[{"title": "The Problem Statement", "ImageAlt": "TOT Learning website mockup alongside iPhone showing the mobile experience", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784274450091-055bbe046e08.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784273582054-963fcaf9184b.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "TOT Learning occupies a unique position in the market. Unlike traditional preschools or neighborhood daycare centers, the organization operates at the intersection of childcare, education, employee wellbeing, and workplace infrastructure. Its audience ranges from HR leaders and corporate decision-makers to working parents seeking reassurance and trust."}, {"description": "The challenge was creating a brand that could simultaneously communicate professionalism to enterprise clients and warmth to parents — structured without appearing institutional, caring without appearing childish, and premium without becoming inaccessible."}]}, {"title": "The Challenge", "ImageAlt": "TOT Learning schedule-a-visit interface showing center visit booking", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784274457031-b8bcb6ca26b8.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784273597014-4999878933b4.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "TOT Learning occupies a unique position in the market. Unlike traditional preschools or neighborhood daycare centers, the organization operates at the intersection of childcare, education, employee wellbeing, and workplace infrastructure. Its audience ranges from HR leaders and corporate decision-makers to working parents seeking reassurance and trust."}, {"description": "The challenge was creating a brand that could simultaneously communicate professionalism to enterprise clients and warmth to parents — structured without appearing institutional, caring without appearing childish, and premium without becoming inaccessible."}]}, {"title": "Discovering the brand.", "ImageAlt": "Brand discovery workshop imagery and exploration visuals", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784274467967-eb38d1e91b18.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784273607932-af4b6c6a58bd.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "Through stakeholder workshops, business discovery sessions, and brand exploration exercises, we uncovered a powerful narrative rooted in trust, responsibility, and care."}, {"description": "What emerged was a simple but powerful insight. Parents are not searching for daycare. They are searching for peace of mind. Organizations are not simply purchasing childcare services. They are investing in employee wellbeing, retention, productivity, and workplace inclusion."}]}, {"title": "Defining a new identity.", "ImageAlt": "TOT Learning brand identity — primary colours, secondary colours, and logo mark", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784274475016-5f03f8d5dadd.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784273634952-f454cb1b52de.png"}, {"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784274476706-200a74035634.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784273637015-8c074bd4edbf.png"}], "layout": "half"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "The new identity needed to move beyond traditional childcare visual language while retaining the warmth that families associate with care and learning."}, {"description": "The resulting system was designed around growth, freedom, nurturing, and trust anchored by a distinctive bird-inspired mark that symbolizes care, aspiration, protection, and development. A refined colour palette and typography hierarchy balance professionalism with accessibility."}]}, {"title": "Bringing the brand to life.", "ImageAlt": "TOT Learning brand applications across signage, stationery, merchandise, and digital communications", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784274482718-2bf063bb6013.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784273660530-05feeffdf13c.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "Beyond the logo, we developed a comprehensive identity system designed to scale across every interaction — signage and stationery, merchandise, digital communications, presentations, and workplace environments."}, {"description": "The new identity transformed TOT Learning from a childcare provider into a recognizable and scalable brand platform ready for future expansion."}]}, {"title": "Optimized for Every Screen", "ImageAlt": "TOT Learning responsive design showcased across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784274491430-4fc794a13ba4.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784273674174-3be4a7947679.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "Recognizing the diversity of devices used for property searches, our design focused on a responsive approach. Regardless of the device, users can expect a seamless and engaging experience."}, {"description": "Our commitment to accessibility and usability shines through as we break down the challenges and triumphs of crafting an app that adapts fluidly to diverse user contexts."}]}, {"title": "Technology Used", "ImageAlt": "Technology stack — Figma and Framer logos with website mockup", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784274495644-cba0b717a5ba.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784273685330-7d8c6ddf42f0.png"}, {"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784274498440-3d2adb893bcf.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784273691601-6593feb42e65.png"}], "layout": "half"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "The final website was developed in Framer as a high-performance, scalable platform capable of supporting TOT Learning’s future growth. The architecture was designed around key conversion journeys — parent inquiries, corporate partnership discussions, center discovery, and brand exploration."}, {"description": "Flexible content structures and CMS-driven sections ensured the team could continue evolving the platform as the organization expands into new regions and partnerships."}]}, {"title": "Our Solution", "ImageAlt": "TOT Learning final website design across desktop and mobile mockups", "subTitle": "", "ImageMobile": "", "mediaBlocks": [{"items": [{"alt": "", "mobileUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784274511750-2986436ac26f.png", "desktopUrl": "/uploads/blog/1784273710824-82bf696579fc.png"}], "layout": "full"}], "videoMobile": "", "ImageDesktop": "", "ImageMobile2": "", "videoDesktop": "", "videoMobile2": "", "ImageDesktop2": "", "videoDesktop2": "", "sectionDescription": [{"description": "The transformation of TOT Learning extended far beyond aesthetics. A legacy childcare organization was reintroduced to the market with a renewed sense of purpose, clarity, and confidence. The new identity captures the balance between care and professionalism that defines the organization. The website translates that positioning into an intuitive digital experience designed to build trust, answer questions, and support growth."}]}]	Conclusion	[{"image": "", "content": "The TOT Learning website successfully redefined the brand’s digital presence through a balance of emotional storytelling, modern design systems, and intuitive user experiences. By combining clarity with warmth, the platform now creates a stronger connection with parents while delivering a seamless and engaging browsing experience across every touchpoint."}]	2026-07-16 13:03:20.987+00	2026-07-16 11:17:35.385383+00	2026-07-25 11:10:16.512379+00	\N	\N	\N	https://pub-92e6c519d94e4cfaa06f90db8f64c6a9.r2.dev/uploads/blog/1784977807518-fb17fe8a29b5.png
